    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Brach to call NSPE function
**'blxns'**
--
+ Software push GPRs to Secure-Stack
+ Software clean 'R0~R3, R12'
    &gt;  Toolchain auto-insert
+ CPU hardware flow
    1. Push the 'return-addr' to Secure-Stack (MSP_S)
    2. Put FNC_RETURN tag (0xFEFFFFFE)to $LR
    3. CPU changes to Non-Secure state
        &gt; Switch to Non-Secure-Stack (MSP_NS)
    4.  Put NSPE-Address to $PC
style=wordwrap</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>40</x>
      <y>430</y>
      <w>310</w>
      <h>210</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>NSPE function with 
**__attribute__((cmse_nonsecure_call))**

Return to SPE function
**bx $LR**
--
+ CPU hardware flow
    1. CPU detects $LR is FNC_RETURN tag 
       (0xFEFFFFFE)
    2. CPU changes to Secure state
        &gt; Switch to Secure-Stack (MSP_S)
    3. Pop 'return-addr' to $PC

style=wordwrap</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
